\0
Imperium researchers on Corlbad developed a weapon called the Dessicator. This chemical catalyst consumed water molecules and could decimate all life on an entire planet in a matter of minutes. As the weapon was nearing completion, the Imperium made plans to move it from the research facility where it was developed to Corlbad's capitol, where it could be transported off of the planet. The Freedom Guard learned of the weapon and the Imperium's plans to move it, and then attacked the research complex in an attempt to intercept the device before the Imperium could get it off Corlbad.
\1
Intelligence suggests that the Imperium has completed the Dessicator and is planning to move it from Corlbad. We must destroy the weapon before it can be moved.  Our weapons researchers have developed a new vehicle, the Phase Runner, which will allow you to transport units underground. You may be able to use the Phase Runner to ambush the research facility. Demolish everything. Make sure we eliminate every trace of the Dessicator.  The Imperium may attempt to evacuate the device once we attack the facility.  Make sure that this does not occur.
\n\n
\cOBJECTIVES\n
\n
-->  Destroy the Imperium base\n
-->  Prevent any evacuation of the Dessicator\n
\s\s\s\s from the area
\2
Your courage is admirable. Forge ahead.\n
\n
\cHISTORICAL OUTCOME:\n
A sizable Freedom Guard attack squad landed on Corlbad and overwhelmed the research facility where the Dessicator was being developed. They intercepted the ground convoy attempting to evacuate the Dessicator from the facility and destroyed it. A number of essential technicians were killed in the raid, and the Imperium was unable to duplicate the weapon for several years after the attack.
\3
Your performance is less than inspiring. Try again.

